flowchart TD
    Start([Input arg]) --> CheckEnv{merman-cli<br/>on PATH?}
    CheckEnv -->|No| EnvFail[exit 2: install hint]
    CheckEnv -->|Yes| TypeCheck{Input type?}

    TypeCheck -->|stdin -| ReadStdin[Read stdin as one block]
    TypeCheck -->|.mmd| ReadMmd[Read file as one block]
    TypeCheck -->|.md| ExtractFences[Extract every mermaid fence]
    TypeCheck -->|other| BadInput[exit 2: unsupported]

    ReadStdin --> Loop
    ReadMmd --> Loop
    ExtractFences --> Loop

    Loop[For each block] --> Parse[merman-cli parse]
    Parse --> ParseOk{Parse OK?}
    ParseOk -->|No| RecordFail[Print PARSE FAILED + error] --> NextBlock
    ParseOk -->|Yes| Render[merman-cli render --format ascii]

    Render --> RenderOk{Render OK?}
    RenderOk -->|No| RenderGap[Note coverage gap, count as OK] --> NextBlock
    RenderOk -->|Yes| SizeCheck{Lines under cap?}

    SizeCheck -->|Yes| Inline[Print ASCII inline] --> NextBlock
    SizeCheck -->|No| Spill[Write tempfile + print pointer] --> NextBlock

    NextBlock{More blocks?} -->|Yes| Loop
    NextBlock -->|No| Summary{Any failures?}
    Summary -->|No| ExitOk[exit 0: N OK]
    Summary -->|Yes| ExitFail[exit 1: M FAILED]
